Package: slicenv
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Slicenv maintainers <packaging@example.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: squashfs-tools
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Description: 3D printing slicer front-end (OrcaSlicer / Bambu Studio engines)
 Slicenv arranges and orients models on build plates, edits print, filament
 and printer profiles and drives OrcaSlicer or Bambu Studio command-line
 engines to produce G-code, with a fast GPU preview. Includes slicenv-mcp,
 an MCP server for AI agents.
 .
 Slicing engines and the proprietary Bambu network plugin are not included;
 they are downloaded on demand, the plugin only with the user's consent.
